        "mechanism_heading": "The Click Tells You What Your Swing Cannot",
        "mechanism_copy": "<p>An early click tells you the club is releasing too soon. A click closer to impact helps you connect the feel of better lag and release timing without an app, a net, or complicated swing thoughts.</p>",
        "how_to_heading": "How To Use The Pro Swing Click Trainer",
        "how_to_copy": "<p>Use short, focused reps to train the timing you want before you take the feel back to your normal club.</p>",
        "how_to_note": "<p>Start slow. The point is timing, not swinging harder.</p>",
